    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Noon Stone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noon Stone is an exploration and survival game inspired by solo tabletop role-playing games. Your mission: find a lost crystal named Noon Stone, in a hostile world. Every day counts, dangers grow, and enemies become stronger. Will you make the right choices to survive and triumph before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/af75e06e76d26222fac0a69cdb626bb3.poster.avif?t=1749734412\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/af75e06e76d26222fac0a69cdb626bb3.webm?t=1749734412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/af75e06e76d26222fac0a69cdb626bb3.mp4?t=1749734412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Dice-driven tactical battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Explore randomly generated maps and survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Build your character with gear, skills, and luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Fast 5-15 minute runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Endless replayability with evolving strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Simple to learn, challenging to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A black-and-white world with hand-drawn look</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaf Challenge yourself and beat your own score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/8e2ef8f3f2865042421fa5c8c6286c63.poster.avif?t=1749734412\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/8e2ef8f3f2865042421fa5c8c6286c63.webm?t=1749734412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/8e2ef8f3f2865042421fa5c8c6286c63.mp4?t=1749734412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it plays</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll your hero</strong>: Random class and stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>: Choose your path across a hexagonal map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong>: Battle enemies with dice rolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong>: Find settlements to sell loot and upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt clues</strong>: Search for the Noon Stone's location</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow stronger</strong>: Gain XP and level up your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong>: Outlast rising dangers and evolving enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score</strong>: Beat your previous high score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/7bed35c3488e6e11b3fccb4ed6a4c8bc.poster.avif?t=1749734412\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/7bed35c3488e6e11b3fccb4ed6a4c8bc.webm?t=1749734412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642550/extras/7bed35c3488e6e11b3fccb4ed6a4c8bc.mp4?t=1749734412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new adventure every time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. Every map and enemy is randomly generated, making every session a fresh tactical challenge. Experiment, adapt, and see how far your luck and your strategy will take you.</p>",
